==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|ML.|thaumaturgus}}, from {{der|en|grc|θαυματουργός}}, from {{suf|grc|θαῦμα|alt1=θαύματο-|t1=marvel|-ουργός|t2=worker, maker|nocat=1}}. {{doublet|en|thaumaturgus}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[performer]] of [[thaumaturgy]]; a performer of [[miracle]]s; a [[magician]].

